{"sections":[{"slug":"Eckmann--Hilton论证","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Eckmann--Hilton论证"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Eckmann–Hilton <span lang=\"zh\">论证</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Eckmann–Hilton 论证"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Eckmann–Hilton <span lang=\"zh\">论证大致说的是</span>, (<span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">两个相容的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E2-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_2$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">会导致一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如在</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">群对象中的群对象是</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Grp}(\\mathsf{Grp}(\\mathsf{Set})) \\simeq \\mathsf{Ab}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦类型论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, Eckmann–Hilton <span lang=\"zh\">论证给出一个类型</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span> $a$ <span lang=\"zh\">的二阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Omega^2 (A,a)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上两个元素复合的交换</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">也即自反等价</span> $\\mathsf{refl}_a$ <span lang=\"zh\">的两个自等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\alpha,\\beta\\colon \\mathsf{refl}_a = \\mathsf{refl}_a\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">满足的等式</span>\n$$\r\n\\alpha\\cdot\\beta = \\beta\\cdot\\alpha.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}